The AzureOpenAIClient type is not found in the expected path. It might be in a different namespace or assembly. Since the test compilation error is about missing AzureOpenAIClient, I will try to mock the service provider and logger factory instead and test the factory delegate directly to cover the call to GetService on IServiceProvider. This avoids needing to mock AzureOpenAIClient directly.

I will submit a test that creates a mock IServiceProvider and verifies the factory delegate behavior from AddAzureOpenAIAudioToText. This will cover the call to GetService on IServiceProvider.

